      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Domesday Book of 1086 recorded Moseley as Museleie, a name meaning 'mouse clearing' in Old English.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
